{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07008","headline":"送集贤学士伊阙史少府敕放归江东觐省 · 陶翰","name":"送集贤学士伊阙史少府敕放归江东觐省","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"墨客锺张侣，材高吴越珍。\n千门来谒帝，驷马去荣亲。\n吏邑沿清洛，乡山指白苹。\n归期应不远，当及未央春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陶翰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07008.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07008","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}